WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
And braised lion head

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Too oily

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,900
Can only choose one

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,900
Do you have the right to speak?

5
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,900
Look how hungry the children are!

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,900
Eat too much and it can't digest it

7
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
That's your problem as a father.

8
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,380
Later, your grandparents will ask dad if he is good to you.

9
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,910
Remember to say nice things about daddy

10
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:21,940
Fish Moon is very smart

11
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,940
Fish month eat quickly

12
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:29,240
Try grandma’s homemade fish moon

13
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,240
How do you usually live with your father?

14
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:34,070
Dad is so kind to Yuyue

15
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:39,090
Dad lets Yuyue eat snacks costing 100 yuan every week

16
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:42,090
You can still go to the Fish Moon after eating
